The '''Ancient Elevator''' is a {{Special}} {{Rift Transferable}} item in {{Zone|Barrier Street}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Ancient Elevator''' rarely appears to be bid on at {{zone|Barrier Street}}. The top {{Green|15}} bidders win the item.

== Trivia ==
* The '''Ancient Elevator''' was previously given out to players by former admin {{RN|MVP+|Minikloon}} for answering trivia questions.
*The command that used to give an '''Ancient Elevator''' to players was "{{Code|/kloonstairs <player>}}".
*The last '''Ancient Elevator''' with an edition was Edition {{Green|#329}} and was given to {{RN|MVP++|rasmusaj2}}.{{confirm}} 
*An '''Ancient Elevator''' with no player info looked like the following: {{Slot|Ancient Elevator|title=&cAncient Elevator|text=&8Dollar store //&c&lSPECIAL}}

